<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Tour Itineraries &amp; Packages | Fleypat Adventures</title><meta name="description" content="Browse safari, beach, marine and day-trip itineraries from Fleypat Adventures."><meta name="theme-color" content="#a8d832"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css"></head><body><div class="topline"><div class="wrap top-inner"><span>Mombasa, Kenya · Your Adventure Begins Here!</span><span><a href="tel:+254704261626">+254 704 261 626</a> · <a href="mailto:info@fleypatadventures.com">info@fleypatadventures.com</a></span></div></div><header class="header"><div class="wrap nav"><a class="brand" href="index.html"><img src="fleypat-logo.png" alt="Fleypat Adventures logo" onerror="this.style.display='none'"><span>FLEYPAT<small>ADVENTURES</small></span></a><button class="nav-toggle" aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false">☰</button><nav><a href="index.html" class="">Home</a><a href="about.html" class="">About</a><a href="safaris.html" class="">Safaris</a><a href="marine-tours.html" class="">Marine Tours</a><a href="day-trips.html" class="">Day Trips</a><a href="beach-holidays.html" class="">Beach Holidays</a><a href="honeymoon.html" class="">Honeymoons</a><a href="destinations.html" class="">Destinations</a><a href="itineraries.html" class="active">Itineraries</a><a href="services.html" class="">Services</a><a href="transfers.html" class="">Transfers</a><a href="blog.html" class="">Blog</a><a href="partnerships.html" class="">Partnerships</a><a href="contact.html" class="">Contact</a><a class="nav-book" href="contact.html">Book Now</a></nav></div></header><main><section class="page-hero" style="--hero-image:url('itineraries-hero.jpg')"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">Plan your journey</span><h1>Tour Packages & Itineraries</h1><p>Browse suggested journeys across Kenya and East Africa. Every itinerary can be adjusted to your dates and preferences.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><span class="kicker">Featured itineraries</span><h2>Find Your Next Adventure</h2><p>Choose an itinerary to view the suggested day-by-day plan and send an enquiry.</p></div><div class="grid cols-3"><article class="card"><div class="photo"><img src="wasini-boat.jpg" alt="Wasini Island Dolphin &amp; Snorkeling Tour" loading="lazy"></div><div class="card-content"><span class="mini-tag">Full day</span><h3>Wasini Island Dolphin & Snorkeling Tour</h3><p>A coastal day out combining a boat excursion, opportunities to see dolphins, snorkeling when sea conditions allow and a Swahili-style lunch. Full day. From USD 85 / KES 11,000 per person (indicative).</p><a class="link" href="itinerary-wasini-dolphin-snorkeling.html">Discover more →</a></div></article><article class="card"><div class="photo"><img src="tsavo-safari-vehicle.jpg" alt="3-Day Tsavo East &amp; West Safari" loading="lazy"></div><div class="card-content"><span class="mini-tag">3 days / 2 nights</span><h3>3-Day Tsavo East & West Safari</h3><p>Explore the landscapes and wildlife of Tsavo East and Tsavo West on a compact safari. 3 days / 2 nights. From USD 420 / KES 54,000 per person (indicative).</p><a class="link" href="itinerary-tsavo-east-west-3-days.html">Discover more →</a></div></article><article class="card"><div class="photo"><img src="diani-resort.jpg" alt="Diani Beach Coastal Escape" loading="lazy"></div><div class="card-content"><span class="mini-tag">4 days / 3 nights</span><h3>Diani Beach Coastal Escape</h3><p>A relaxed coastal break with time for the beach and optional ocean experiences. 4 days / 3 nights. From USD 350 / KES 45,000 per person (indicative).</p><a class="link" href="itinerary-diani-coastal-escape.html">Discover more →</a></div></article><article class="card"><div class="photo"><img src="zanzibar-tour.jpg" alt="Zanzibar Spice &amp; Stone Town" loading="lazy"></div><div class="card-content"><span class="mini-tag">3 days / 2 nights</span><h3>Zanzibar Spice & Stone Town</h3><p>A short island escape featuring the history of Stone Town and the island’s spice heritage. 3 days / 2 nights. From USD 380 / KES 49,000 per person (indicative).</p><a class="link" href="itinerary-zanzibar-spice-stone-town.html">Discover more →</a></div></article><article class="card"><div class="photo"><img src="lake-nakuru-game-drive.jpg" alt="Lake Nakuru National Park Day Trip" loading="lazy"></div><div class="card-content"><span class="mini-tag">Full day</span><h3>Lake Nakuru National Park Day Trip</h3><p>A full-day wildlife excursion to Lake Nakuru National Park, with game viewing and scenic Rift Valley landscapes. Full day. Request a current quote.</p><a class="link" href="itinerary-lake-nakuru-day-trip.html">Discover more →</a></div></article><article class="card"><div class="photo"><img src="amboseli-safari.jpg" alt="3-Day Amboseli Safari" loading="lazy"></div><div class="card-content"><span class="mini-tag">3 days / 2 nights</span><h3>3-Day Amboseli Safari</h3><p>A short safari to Amboseli, known for elephant herds, open plains and views of Mount Kilimanjaro when clear. 3 days / 2 nights. Request a current quote.</p><a class="link" href="itinerary-amboseli-3-days.html">Discover more →</a></div></article><article class="card"><div class="photo"><img src="mara-safari.jpg" alt="3-Day Maasai Mara Safari" loading="lazy"></div><div class="card-content"><span class="mini-tag">3 days / 2 nights</span><h3>3-Day Maasai Mara Safari</h3><p>A classic safari focused on game drives across the Maasai Mara’s open savannah. 3 days / 2 nights. Request a current quote.</p><a class="link" href="itinerary-maasai-mara-3-days.html">Discover more →</a></div></article><article class="card"><div class="photo"><img src="mara-nakuru-safari.jpg" alt="4-Day Maasai Mara &amp; Lake Nakuru Safari" loading="lazy"></div><div class="card-content"><span class="mini-tag">4 days / 3 nights</span><h3>4-Day Maasai Mara & Lake Nakuru Safari</h3><p>Combine two contrasting wildlife destinations in one Kenya safari. 4 days / 3 nights. Request a current quote.</p><a class="link" href="itinerary-mara-nakuru-4-days.html">Discover more →</a></div></article></div><p class="notice">Prices are indicative where stated. All prices, availability, park fees, accommodation, transport and inclusions must be confirmed in a written quotation before payment.</p></div></section><section class="cta wrap"><div><h2>Ready to plan your next adventure?</h2><p>Tell us what you have in mind and we will prepare a tailored travel proposal.</p></div><a class="btn btn-gold" href="contact.html">Make an Enquiry</a></section></main><footer class="footer"><div class="wrap footer-grid"><div><a class="brand footer-brand" href="index.html"><img src="fleypat-logo.png" alt="Fleypat Adventures logo" onerror="this.style.display='none'"><span>FLEYPAT<small>ADVENTURES</small></span></a><p>Explore more. Experience more. Travel beyond expectations. Your journey starts with us.</p><a href="https://www.instagram.com/fleypat_adventures/">Instagram @fleypat_adventures</a></div><div><h3>Explore</h3><a href="safaris.html">Wildlife Safaris</a><a href="marine-tours.html">Marine Tours</a><a href="day-trips.html">Day Trips</a><a href="beach-holidays.html">Beach Holidays</a><a href="destinations.html">Destinations</a><a href="itineraries.html">Itineraries</a></div><div><h3>Company</h3><a href="about.html">About Us</a><a href="services.html">Our Services</a><a href="transfers.html">Transfers</a><a href="partnerships.html">Partnerships</a><a href="blog.html">Travel Guides</a></div><div><h3>Contact</h3><a href="tel:+254704261626">+254 704 261 626</a><a href="mailto:info@fleypatadventures.com">info@fleypatadventures.com</a><a href="https://wa.me/254704261626">WhatsApp our team</a><span>Mombasa, Kenya</span></div></div><div class="wrap foot-bottom">© <span data-year></span> Fleypat Adventures. All rights reserved.<span>Explore More. Experience More. Travel Beyond Expectations.</span></div></footer><a class="float-wa" href="https://wa.me/254704261626?text=Hello%20Fleypat%20Adventures%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20plan%20a%20trip." target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp Us</a><script src="script.js"></script></body></html>
